 - 2026-06-02: DISAMBIGUATE the re-freeze candidate at full G1-rigor — exp3693 found the published external de-entangled/CIG baseline (0.9287) BEAT the dependency-aware candidate (0.9249). Run dependency-aware vs external vs a FUSION (multi-verifier, arXiv:2502.20379) head-to-head under the FROZEN dual-condition protocol (5-seed, CI, DeLong, adversarial-clean, leak-free), pick the SINGLE strongest candidate > frozen 0.9131, and re-emit the CLEAN operator re-freeze package for THAT winner — PREPARE-ONLY; the frozen 0.9131 stays frozen, the agent never edits north-star.md or triggers the CI run (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: refreeze_disambiguated_no_candidate_beats_frozen_headline_stays_0_9131; results/experiment_3704_refreeze_disambiguate_dependency_vs_external_vs_fusion.json
 - 2026-06-02: Adversarial leak-audit + HELD-OUT replication of the code-native verifier — exp3695 returned code AUROC=1.0, which is IMPLAUSIBLE_PERFECT (the exp1851/exp3397 fabrication pattern + the AUROC>=0.99-is-a-leak rule). Audit for leakage (arXiv:2603.21454 / arXiv:2502.00678), re-measure on a DIFFERENT held-out code corpus (arXiv:2605.11006 / fresh GGUF-generated candidates) with a TraceCoder-style execution-trace signal (arXiv:2602.06875), 5 seeds, larger n. Does the code signal survive HELD-OUT with a CI excluding 0.5 and AUROC < 0.99 (i.e. a real, non-leaked signal), or was the 1.0 a leak/separable-by-construction artifact? (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: code_native_one_point_zero_was_a_leak_code_claim_narrowed_earned; results/experiment_3705_code_native_leak_audit_heldout.json
 - 2026-06-02: Reconcile the SHIPPED detector's code operating point with the exp3705 held-out audit — the detector (exp3696) was re-wired on exp3695's AUROC=1.0; if exp3705 shows the code signal survives held-out, recalibrate the shipped code operating point to the HELD-OUT number; if it was a leak, NARROW the shipped detector back to math-only with an explicit abstain-on-code path. Re-run the E2E green. The shipped surface must be honest either way (runs unconditionally) (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: shipped_detector_narrowed_to_math_only_abstain_on_code_e2e_green; results/experiment_3706_reconcile_shipped_detector_heldout.json
+- 2026-06-02: FORMALLY CLOSE the discrimination-vs-selection diagnosis question (recommend retirement, do NOT grind a third attempt) — exp3672 stands as the earned-negative (ensemble discriminates ~0.93 but selects worse than SC); the diagnosis-of-WHY blocked twice (exp3682 degenerate no-op, exp3694 no multi-candidate corpus); energy-selection is settled-bounded per the project memory + arXiv:2512.23067 (Reward Model Selection Crisis). Record the closure + an operator retirement recommendation; doc/synthesis-only (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: selection_diagnosis_formally_closed_retirement_recommended_to_operator; results/experiment_3707_selection_diagnosis_formal_closure.json
